Unreleased
---
Nothing recorded yet.

This file exists so that a change to `qxtheme` has somewhere to go. Decision K24
asks for the library-level log to be written as the change lands, under a heading
like `Feature` / `Interface` / `Optimize` / `Bugfix` / `Deprecated` / `Cleanup` /
`Test`, and for this section to be renamed to the new version when the version
number moves.

Released sections are deliberately **not** reconstructed here: K24's rule is
"no retroactive", so the history before this point stays in the commit log rather
than being rewritten as change log entries.

`qxtheme` is the one library of the four added together that has had no source
change at all since 3.3.0, so it is opened empty rather than because something
was left unrecorded.
